  "engine": "vMix GT native",
  "differences": [
    "GT uses CubicEasingOut/In; arbitrary CSS cubic-bezier curves are not supported.",
    "Text fades at the original timings; the CSS 24px translation is not reproduced.",
    "Logo/LIVE use directional reveals; CSS 20px translation is not reproduced.",
    "Topic and location widths are fixed editable design dimensions, rather than browser content measurement.",
    "GT auto-shrink changes font size instead of browser horizontal text squishing.",
    "Headline panel corners are square; the browser has a 16px top-left radius.",
    "Clock follows Windows local time; change WIB suffix and Windows timezone together."
  ],
